{"id":"00188","root":"uni00188_1","name":{"ja":"カテジナ","en":"Catejina"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"カテジナ","en":"Catejina"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2019-04-30","limited":false,"characterId":148,"profile":{"ja":"生まれつき呪われた体質を持つ魔族の女性。その呪いとは、彼女と一定の時を過ごした者が全て死んでしまうというもの。そのため彼女は一箇所にとどまれず、魔界を放浪していた。しかしその特異な体質と、類まれなる美貌から、彼女の存在はすぐに噂となってしまう。特にその美貌はあらゆる種族の異性を魅了し、傍に置けば呪われると知ってなお、彼女を欲する男達は少なくなかった。やがてカテジナは人間界に逃げるが、“呪いの美女”の噂は人間の間にも広まり、今度は彼女を欲しがる人間たちから逃れる日々を送っている。","en":"(Catejina, she/her) A demon woman born with a cursed condition: anyone who spends a certain amount of time with her inevitably dies. Because of this, she cannot stay in one place and has roamed the Demon Realm. Her unique curse and extraordinary beauty quickly turned her into a rumor. Her looks enchant members of every race, and despite knowing the curse, many men still desire her. Eventually Catejina fled to the Human Realm, but the \"cursed beauty\" gossip spread among humans as well, and now she spends her days evading those who would claim her."},"illustrator":"さのとしひで","voiceActor":"鶴屋春人","forms":[{"id":"uni00188_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1006,2012],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[132,264],"def":[121,242],"spd":[61,61],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","180007"]},{"id":"uni00188_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1512,3024],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[199,398],"def":[177,354],"spd":[61,61],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","180007","180008"]},{"id":"uni00188_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2018,4087],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[271,544],"def":[238,467],"spd":[61,61],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","180007","180008"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp